@dsh-external/dsh-nx README · 1. junction into the profile：New-Item -ItemType Junction `
  -Path  "$env:USERPROFILE\.dsh\profiles\web\node_modules\@dsh-external\dsh-nx" `
  -Target "D:\deepseek_harness\dsh-nx"

@dsh-external/dsh-nx README · What `deploy` will and will not claim：`deploy` reports compile, sign and install **separately**, because they fail for
different reasons and only one of them is about your code.

Two facts worth knowing, both learned the hard way on NX 2412:

@dsh-external/dsh-nx README · Verification：Observed on NX 2412 / Windows 11 (2026-10-26): `launch` → port open in 8–12 s,
`status` → 123 tools, `call` → working modelling calls, `capture` → a 17 KB render
of the model.
